1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,160
My daughter left the fan running in the car and it is still going.
我女儿把风扇忘在车里一直开着，结果现在还在转。

2
00:00:03,161 --> 00:00:06,641
This last up to 52 hours on a single charge.
充一次电最长能用52小时。

3
00:00:06,642 --> 00:00:07,801
That's insane.
太夸张了。

4
00:00:07,802 --> 00:00:09,561
This is the coolest portable fan
这台便携风扇真的很棒，

5
00:00:09,562 --> 00:00:12,201
for half the prices anywhere else you can get them.
价格只有其他地方同类产品的一半。

6
00:00:12,202 --> 00:00:14,161
It comes with four different fan modes.
它有四档风速，

7
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:15,681
It also has a light function.
还有照明功能，

8
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:17,521
Three different light modes as well.
灯光也有三档。

9
00:00:17,522 --> 00:00:19,681
It also serves as a battery powered charger
它还能当充电宝，

10
00:00:19,682 --> 00:00:21,841
so you can hook up all your cell phones devices
你可以接上手机和其他设备，

11
00:00:21,842 --> 00:00:23,241
and charge them from here.
直接从这里充电。

12
00:00:23,242 --> 00:00:25,181
It oscillates as well.
它也能自动摇头。

13
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,440
From the coolest parts.
还有一个很棒的地方，

14
00:00:26,441 --> 00:00:29,041
You can turn this upside down and hang it from a hook.
你可以把它翻过来，用挂钩吊起来。

15
00:00:29,042 --> 00:00:31,801
So it also has that remote to easily control it.
它还配了遥控器，操作很方便。

16
00:00:31,802 --> 00:00:32,441
Anywhere you at?
无论你在哪里都能用。

17
00:00:32,442 --> 00:00:34,361
We are burning up in Texas already
我们得克萨斯州现在已经热得不行了，

18
00:00:34,362 --> 00:00:36,941
and this is traveling everywhere with us this summer.
今年夏天走到哪儿，我们都要带上它。
